  "review_notes": [
    "Corrected τὰ πρὸς εἰρήνην: the supplied relativizer 'which' moves from πρός onto the substantival article under rules 31, 32 and 62, leaving 'belong unto' on the preposition headed on 'unto'. Every other unit is unchanged.",
